Z||000012||Slammed Fiero||07-05-2001||06:14 PM||||Well ..there no grand national thats for sure..<P>haha<P>I got to do a couple track days at boundrant with one , what a joy to drive around a track. Nice smooth linear power , you could plant the car perfectly on every apex. Good car to pass off as a family car and still have a lot of fun.<P>wolf in sheeps clothing<P>JM ||||reg||1
